sentences.text:
The petitioner/accused No.1 is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.264/2023 registered by the Peenya police station, Bengaluru City, for the offences punishable under Sections 498A, 306 r/w 34 of IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees One lakhs only)
with one surety for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;

